## 6. Tests
Playwright against MSW: crew report → review → submit; Master receives a mocked `ticket.new` and acknowledges; dashboard accept → reply → draft learning → publish. A build check that fails if `apps/crew/dist` references any `http(s)://` host other than relative URLs.
